\eqn{u_j ~ N(0, \sigma_u)} (via \code{icc}), person feature
\eqn{x_i ~ N(0,1)}, and residual \eqn{e ~ N(0,1)}.

\strong{All "stressors" are off by default} (\code{tau = 0}, \code{tau_x = 0},
\code{dropout = 0}): effects, personalization, or dropout must be
switched on explicitly.
